<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hide</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Thief, Assassin (guild level 0), Ranger (guild level 0, up to 75%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>hide
</pre>
<p>You slip into the shadows. While you are hidden, others who come by or 
look around don't see you in the room. Type hide again to come out.
</p><p>Your skill decides how well it goes, with your dexterity and brain. You 
can't always tell: you "try to hide yourself" either way, but if you 
failed, you aren't hidden at all, and the messages you get while you wait 
give a hint ("Maybe you should practice this hide-thing"). <a cmd='#'>score</a> tells 
you for sure: it says "You are hiding" while you are.
</p><p>Hiding wears off after a while. It ends at once if someone attacks you. 
Those with sense life still feel that a hidden life form is in the room.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sneaking</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sense Life</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Search</a>
</pre>




</div>